Nama dia [NAMA]. 
Dia <segment id='1' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>besaral</segment> dari Jepang. 
Dia lahir di <segment id='2' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>Miyasaki</segment>, besar di <segment id='3' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' correction='Kanagawa'>Kabagawa</segment>. 
Sekarang dia <segment id='4' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>tinggil</segment> di Kanawa, Beppu. 
Dia mahasiswa <segment id='5' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>fakultas</segment> APM, <segment id='6' features='eror;leksikal;kata;negs' state='active' correction='bukan'><segment id='8' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='6'>tidal</segment></segment> mahasiswa jurusan. 
Dia <segment id='7' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>tidal</segment> bekerja sampingan. 
Hobi dia menonton anime. 
Dia ikut <segment id='9' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>klub</segment> Duct di APU.    </body>
